Here is the implementation of the function to compute the elasticity tensor components:
```cpp
template <int dim>
double FEM<dim>::C(unsigned int i,unsigned int j,unsigned int k,unsigned int l){

  double E=2.0e11,
    nu=0.3;
  double lambda=(E*nu)/((1.+nu)*(1.-2.*nu)),
    mu=E/(2.*(1.+nu));

