The `basis_function` is implemented as follows:

```cpp
template <int dim>
double FEM<dim>::basis_function(unsigned int node, double xi_1, double xi_2){
  return (xi_1 + xi_A[node][0])*(xi_2 + xi_A[node][1])/(4.*xi_A[node][0]*xi_A[node][1]);
}
